{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"9d1f24893e380b1d","type":"text","x":0,"y":0,"width":760,"height":440,"text":"# Opción inválida\n\nManeja las respuestas no válidas del cliente. Suma un error en `num_errores`; con 1 o 2 errores avisa y reenvía el menú del paso actual; al 3.º error cierra la conversación (Chatwoot resolved, `paso = 1000`).\n\n**Disparador:** Webhook POST `/webhook/opcion-invalida-claro-movil`.\n\n**Llama a:** `inactividad-claro-movil` (nodo Activar inactividad)\n\n**Es llamado por:** Principal V3 (nodo Llamar opción inválida)\n\n**Nodos:** 23  ·  Detalle: [[Documentacion-Opcion-Invalida]]","color":"4"},
		{"id":"daaedff3b9b6f8b6","type":"text","x":820,"y":0,"width":380,"height":300,"text":"### Leyenda de colores\n🟢 Disparador (webhook / cron)\n🟣 MySQL (tabla `claro_movil`)\n🟡 Condición (IF / Switch)\n🟠 Variables / código\n🔵 Chatwoot / HTTP\n🔴 Envío WhatsApp (hay que cambiarlo a WAHA)\n\n⚠️ = nodo a intervenir en la migración a WAHA."},
		{"id":"4de7464c01e22be3","type":"text","x":0,"y":652,"width":440,"height":246,"text":"## Webhook\n`Webhook`\n\nRecibe del Principal: cliente, conversación, cuenta, tipo, paso, URLs, claves y sesión.\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST /webhook/opcion-invalida-claro-movil\n","color":"4"},
		{"id":"ce1d4e7dbb1e5e8f","type":"text","x":740,"y":628,"width":440,"height":294,"text":"## Obtener estado\n`MySQL`\n\nLee `num_errores` actual del cliente.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- Operación: SELECT sobre `claro_movil`\n- Lee: COALESCE(num_errores,0) AS num_errores\n","color":"6"},
		{"id":"1efd805ca4f0d1a6","type":"text","x":1480,"y":664,"width":440,"height":222,"text":"## Code\n`Code (JS)`\n\nSuma 1 al contador `num_errores`.\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- Devuelve: num_errores\n","color":"2"},
		{"id":"8135198fdc6e902f","type":"text","x":2220,"y":628,"width":440,"height":294,"text":"## Validar cierre chat\n`IF`\n\nSi `num_errores ≥ 3` cierra la conversación; si no, avisa y reenvía el menú.\n\n**Lee:** `(entrada).num_errores`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- $json.num_errores >= 3\n","color":"3"},
		{"id":"396e1fe49b2db73f","type":"text","x":2960,"y":568,"width":440,"height":414,"text":"## Cierre Chatwoot\n`HTTP Request`\n\nPublica en Chatwoot el aviso de cierre automático por respuestas no identificadas.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/messages\n- Body: content, message_type\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"017a6ffd81e2af31","type":"text","x":2960,"y":1072,"width":440,"height":414,"text":"## Aviso Chatwoot\n`HTTP Request`\n\nPublica en Chatwoot el aviso \"No reconocimos tu respuesta\".\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/messages\n- Body: content, message_type\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"25b9c0748790dab6","type":"text","x":3700,"y":520,"width":440,"height":510,"text":"## Cierre WhatsApp\n`HTTP Request`\n\nEnvía el mismo aviso de cierre por WhatsApp.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_evolution`, `Webhook.body.session`, `Webhook.body.api_evolution`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_evolution}/message/sendText/{session}\n- Body: number, text\n- Headers: apikey\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Envío: URL `/message/sendText/{session}` → `/api/sendText`; header `apikey` → `X-Api-Key`; body `number` → `chatId` (`…@c.us`) + `session`.\n","color":"1"},
		{"id":"52cda20cde76c171","type":"text","x":3700,"y":1120,"width":440,"height":534,"text":"## Aviso WhatsApp\n`HTTP Request`\n\nEnvía por WhatsApp el aviso \"No reconocimos tu respuesta\".\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_evolution`, `Webhook.body.session`, `Webhook.body.api_evolution`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_evolution}/message/sendText/{session}\n- Body: number, text\n- Headers: apikey\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Envío: URL `/message/sendText/{session}` → `/api/sendText`; header `apikey` → `X-Api-Key`; body `number` → `chatId` (`…@c.us`) + `session`.\n","color":"1"},
		{"id":"278bb293994de134","type":"text","x":4440,"y":568,"width":440,"height":414,"text":"## Cerrar chat (resolved)\n`HTTP Request`\n\nCambia el estado de la conversación a `resolved` en Chatwoot (`toggle_status`).\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/toggle_status\n- Body: status\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d5812576c55429bb","type":"text","x":4440,"y":1192,"width":440,"height":390,"text":"## ¿Qué menú reenviar?\n`Switch`\n\nSegún `estado_actual` (1–5) elige qué menú volver a mostrar; por defecto el 2.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.estado_actual`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- salida 1 ⇢ 1\n- salida 2 ⇢ 2\n- salida 3 ⇢ 3\n- salida 4 ⇢ 4\n- salida 5 ⇢ 5\n","color":"3"},
		{"id":"9eef326983bf0d94","type":"text","x":5180,"y":604,"width":440,"height":342,"text":"## Actualizar estado6\n`MySQL`\n\nActualiza `num_errores` y deja `paso = 1000` (conversación cerrada).\n\n**Lee:** `Code.num_errores`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- Operación: UPDATE sobre `claro_movil`\n- Escribe: num_errores, paso, fecha_modificacion\n","color":"6"},
		{"id":"8a54a8fe116ea439","type":"text","x":5180,"y":1180,"width":440,"height":414,"text":"## Menú 1 Chatwoot\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía en Chatwoot el mensaje de bienvenida del paso 1.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/messages\n- Body: content, message_type\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"10d2674d8040bdb1","type":"text","x":5180,"y":1684,"width":440,"height":390,"text":"## Menú 4 Chatwoot1\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía en Chatwoot la lista de ofertas.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/messages\n- Body: content, message_type\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"1d924ab7b837d71b","type":"text","x":5180,"y":2164,"width":440,"height":414,"text":"## Menú 3 Chatwoot1\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía en Chatwoot la pregunta SI/NO de portabilidad.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/messages\n- Body: content, message_type\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e6496e4c16afb296","type":"text","x":5180,"y":2668,"width":440,"height":390,"text":"## Menú 2 Chatwoot1\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía en Chatwoot el menú de 5 opciones.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/messages\n- Body: content, message_type\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"90853a2afa59ea76","type":"text","x":5180,"y":3148,"width":440,"height":390,"text":"## Menú 5 Chatwoot\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía en Chatwoot el texto de habeas data.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_chatwoot`, `Webhook.body.id_cuenta`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.api_chatwoot`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_chatwoot}/api/v1/accounts/{id_cuenta}/conversations/{id_conversacion}/messages\n- Body: content, message_type\n- Headers: api_access_token\n","color":"5"},
		{"id":"97bfa42e67b7e3b9","type":"text","x":5920,"y":1120,"width":440,"height":534,"text":"## Menú 1 WhatsApp\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía por WhatsApp el mensaje del paso 1 (\"responde SI\").\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_evolution`, `Webhook.body.session`, `Webhook.body.api_evolution`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_evolution}/message/sendText/{session}\n- Body: number, text\n- Headers: apikey\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Envío: URL `/message/sendText/{session}` → `/api/sendText`; header `apikey` → `X-Api-Key`; body `number` → `chatId` (`…@c.us`) + `session`.\n","color":"1"},
		{"id":"21fbdc9af05a6e0a","type":"text","x":5920,"y":1744,"width":440,"height":510,"text":"## Menú 4 WhatsApp1\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía por WhatsApp la lista de ofertas.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_evolution`, `Webhook.body.session`, `Webhook.body.api_evolution`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_evolution}/message/sendText/{session}\n- Body: number, text\n- Headers: apikey\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Envío: URL `/message/sendText/{session}` → `/api/sendText`; header `apikey` → `X-Api-Key`; body `number` → `chatId` (`…@c.us`) + `session`.\n","color":"1"},
		{"id":"01f7ce53dd40f1d1","type":"text","x":5920,"y":2344,"width":440,"height":534,"text":"## Menú 3 WhatsApp1\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía por WhatsApp la pregunta SI/NO de portabilidad.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_evolution`, `Webhook.body.session`, `Webhook.body.api_evolution`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_evolution}/message/sendText/{session}\n- Body: number, text\n- Headers: apikey\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Envío: URL `/message/sendText/{session}` → `/api/sendText`; header `apikey` → `X-Api-Key`; body `number` → `chatId` (`…@c.us`) + `session`.\n","color":"1"},
		{"id":"09561304de4c0c83","type":"text","x":5920,"y":2968,"width":440,"height":510,"text":"## Menú 2 WhatsApp1\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía por WhatsApp el menú de 5 opciones.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_evolution`, `Webhook.body.session`, `Webhook.body.api_evolution`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_evolution}/message/sendText/{session}\n- Body: number, text\n- Headers: apikey\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Envío: URL `/message/sendText/{session}` → `/api/sendText`; header `apikey` → `X-Api-Key`; body `number` → `chatId` (`…@c.us`) + `session`.\n","color":"1"},
		{"id":"129ad47dcf462f04","type":"text","x":5920,"y":3568,"width":440,"height":510,"text":"## Menú 5 WhatsApp\n`HTTP Request`\n\nReenvía por WhatsApp el texto de habeas data.\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.url_evolution`, `Webhook.body.session`, `Webhook.body.api_evolution`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST {url_evolution}/message/sendText/{session}\n- Body: number, text\n- Headers: apikey\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Envío: URL `/message/sendText/{session}` → `/api/sendText`; header `apikey` → `X-Api-Key`; body `number` → `chatId` (`…@c.us`) + `session`.\n","color":"1"},
		{"id":"63946c84d502a1ee","type":"text","x":6660,"y":2438,"width":440,"height":342,"text":"## Actualizar num_errores\n`MySQL`\n\nGuarda el nuevo `num_errores` y actualiza `fecha_modificacion`.\n\n**Lee:** `Code.num_errores`, `Webhook.body.cliente`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- Operación: UPDATE sobre `claro_movil`\n- Escribe: num_errores, fecha_modificacion\n","color":"6"},
		{"id":"67489132572b8141","type":"text","x":7400,"y":2342,"width":440,"height":534,"text":"## Activar inactividad\n`HTTP Request`\n\nPOST al webhook `/webhook/inactividad-claro-movil` con cliente, conversación y sesión (reinicia la vigilancia por inactividad).\n\n**Lee:** `Webhook.body.cliente`, `Webhook.body.id_conversacion`, `Webhook.body.session`\n\n**Maneja / produce:**\n- POST https://2031510-n8n.interactivo.com.co/webhook/inactividad-claro-movil\n- Body: cliente, id_conversacion, session\n- Headers: Content-Type\n\n⚠️ **Intervenir (WAHA):**\n- Dominio n8n `2031510-n8n…` vs `n8n-general…` (donde apunta WAHA): confirmar cuál es el vigente.\n","color":"5"}
	],
